  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fZelvonn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1560248/description_d82838d9-0073-4fbe-aef0-030fe4cf566d.png\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fZelvonn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apex 伺服器託管</a></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>關於：</strong>&nbsp; Twixxel 的模組包是一款心理恐怖模組包，旨在根據 Twixxel 的影片將 Minecraft 轉變為令人不安且不可預測的體驗。你探索得越深，世界開始發生的變化就越多。不該出現的地方會出現奇怪的結構。無法解釋的聲音在黑暗中迴盪。有時會看到人影在遠處注視著你，然後無蹤消失。你永遠無法完全確定你所看到的是否真實，是否有東西跟蹤你，或者你是否真的孤身一人。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>影片：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252ft%252fZP8s5Facq%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.tiktok.com/t/ZP8s5Facq/</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>特別感謝</strong>:&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Tsariulll，感謝你告訴我「別哭」模組（主要模組）</span></h3>",
